shots.purpose:
Stage 2b, in the winning finish. The kit pieces the build needs:
- each bowl as its own part, so the hover rim and lift still work;
- a dry bowl large enough for the full 5.9 x 2.4 m oval;
- terrace dam faces with flowstone;
- the mouth sill with steps and a brook channel;
- the low outflow arch, landing and root-stair landing;
- thick roots, no ink-noise strands.
There is no oculus rim (never in frame) and no frost crust (frost is live state).

